WEBVTT

00:11.830 --> 00:15.040
Princess-Style Barrier Arts: Cage.

00:15.750 --> 00:19.000
A silverine cage woven
with layer upon layer.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.080
It will certainly be difficult for
the dragons to move through this.

00:22.080 --> 00:24.790
Your Highness, what are your thoughts?

00:24.790 --> 00:28.380
What do you think about
what Crish Weiss said?

00:29.960 --> 00:34.710
Do you believe they defeated the Tenth,
Eighth, and Third Seats back-to-back

00:34.710 --> 00:37.170
and battled the Dragon Monarch
in the capital?

00:37.170 --> 00:39.380
Personally, I find it hard to believe.

00:39.380 --> 00:41.380
Good grief, Ike.

00:41.380 --> 00:43.670
You really are glasses.

00:44.540 --> 00:49.460
Everything that filth said is clearly
a mixture of falsehood and truth.

00:49.710 --> 00:52.290
Don't let him run the show.

00:52.290 --> 00:55.460
Pay no heed to any
nonessential information.

00:56.000 --> 00:57.210
Right.

00:57.210 --> 01:00.290
But there is one thing I can't overlook.

01:01.210 --> 01:03.880
Superior dragons were once human.

01:03.880 --> 01:07.750
Their monarch gave them their blood,
and that granted them inhuman power.

01:08.250 --> 01:11.920
This is the case for even Olto Zora and
Taratectra, the two we'll be facing soon.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.750
When the two of them were human,
they were famous warriors.

01:16.710 --> 01:18.540
That is true.

01:18.540 --> 01:21.000
I had suspected as much myself.

01:21.000 --> 01:22.250
What?

01:22.250 --> 01:25.130
The twins, Majorca, Fu...

01:25.710 --> 01:28.540
People born with high levels
of innate magical power

01:28.540 --> 01:31.540
often have nonhuman features.

01:31.960 --> 01:35.130
The greater the magical power,
the more striking these features are.

01:35.130 --> 01:39.460
So, what exactly are the superior dragons
who look human?

01:39.460 --> 01:42.540
Why does the highest order of dragons
mimic the human form?

01:42.540 --> 01:43.630
It's exactly the reverse!

01:44.630 --> 01:48.750
Dragons aren't mimicking humans;
they're humans who became dragons!

01:48.750 --> 01:50.880
That line of thinking makes sense to me.

01:50.880 --> 01:53.710
Wait a moment.
I can't wrap my head around this.

01:53.710 --> 01:55.420
Superior dragons are human?

01:55.420 --> 01:57.130
Then our upcoming battle...

01:57.130 --> 02:01.250
Not just this battle, but the whole war
between humans and dragons...

02:01.250 --> 02:03.130
What difference does it make?

02:03.580 --> 02:06.750
would be even better if they were
a different species than us.

02:06.750 --> 02:09.670
After all, humans kill and eat other animals.

02:10.170 --> 02:13.420
But what difference does it make
that they used to be human?

02:13.420 --> 02:16.380
That only means we have
even more reason to kill them!

02:17.500 --> 02:19.170
Do not waver, Ike.

02:20.420 --> 02:21.710
The enemy is the enemy.

02:21.710 --> 02:23.250
We kill our enemies.

02:23.250 --> 02:24.750
We kill them...

02:25.250 --> 02:26.920
and survive!

04:03.790 --> 04:08.290
<b>Episode 12: Determination and Readiness</b>

04:05.670 --> 04:08.290
It looked like you were having a lovely dream.

04:08.580 --> 04:10.580
I didn't want to wake you.

04:11.460 --> 04:12.960
What time is it?

04:13.670 --> 04:15.040
It's three in the morning on the ninth.

04:15.460 --> 04:17.040
Is your task going well?

04:17.040 --> 04:19.630
It's coming along.
What have you been doing?

04:20.000 --> 04:23.330
I taught the savages a thing or two.

04:23.710 --> 04:27.080
I think they'll pull off their
magic circle just fine now.

04:27.080 --> 04:28.460
Seems like he's having fun.

04:28.460 --> 04:34.170
There's still a lot to do, but I thought
I'd address some of your doubts.

04:35.500 --> 04:39.880
You're wondering why I told you not to use
Silverine Battle Arts, aren't you?

04:40.630 --> 04:41.710
Yeah, I am.

04:41.710 --> 04:46.710
First, there is one thing I need to ask you.

04:47.000 --> 04:51.210
Could you win against Woltekamui
if you fought him now?

04:52.130 --> 04:53.330
I would...

04:56.130 --> 04:57.330
not win.

04:57.710 --> 04:59.210
What a relief.

04:59.210 --> 05:01.500
If you had been needlessly
stubborn about that,

05:01.500 --> 05:04.460
my opinion of you would have
lowered even more.

05:05.170 --> 05:07.960
Even among superior dragons, he's special.

05:08.540 --> 05:12.380
Just like you, he's surpassed
the limits of power.

05:13.130 --> 05:15.500
You shouldn't face him head-on.

05:16.290 --> 05:19.750
Especially when you're
nowhere near peak condition.

05:20.210 --> 05:23.040
That's the reason you can't use
Silverine Battle Arts.

05:23.210 --> 05:25.460
I don't understand. What do you mean?

05:25.460 --> 05:28.040
The other side already knows about you.

05:28.040 --> 05:31.210
They know there is a human
who emits silverine from his body,

05:31.210 --> 05:34.920
and that an average superior dragon
doesn't stand a chance against you.

05:34.920 --> 05:36.290
That means...

05:36.920 --> 05:40.130
Woltekamui will come here.

05:41.170 --> 05:45.380
For now, he won't leave Ultimatia's side.

05:45.380 --> 05:48.830
She was almost killed while he was gone.

05:48.830 --> 05:52.540
But what if they find out you're here?

05:52.920 --> 05:55.500
Olto Zora will not hesitate to summon Kamui.

05:55.500 --> 05:57.830
He'll rush over at the speed of lightning.

05:57.830 --> 06:01.040
We can't beat him. We'll lose.

06:01.790 --> 06:05.380
We can't crush them with your strength

06:05.380 --> 06:08.790
or trick them with my schemes alone.

06:09.170 --> 06:13.290
We don't have the advantage of surprise
anymore, and our enemies are fired up.

06:15.500 --> 06:17.500
This will be a bloody battle.

06:17.920 --> 06:20.880
I'm going to do my best to save
as many people as possible.

06:20.880 --> 06:23.130
Well, if worst comes to worst,

06:23.130 --> 06:25.960
I'll be happy as long as I can
escape with him.

06:28.170 --> 06:30.670
Crish Weiss isn't in his cell anymore!

06:30.670 --> 06:33.380
Damn it! He better not be trying to...

06:33.960 --> 06:35.080
Fu!

06:35.080 --> 06:37.750
I was just on my way to see you.

06:37.750 --> 06:39.580
Crish Weiss has vanished!

06:39.580 --> 06:42.210
And he demonstrated interest in
your teleportation circ-

06:43.000 --> 06:44.380
Who in the hell...

06:44.380 --> 06:47.500
Fu! Are you okay? What's wro-

06:47.500 --> 06:50.330
Who in the hell is that woman?

06:50.330 --> 06:51.670
Woman?

06:51.670 --> 06:55.290
Because of her our circle is...

06:55.710 --> 06:59.670
So much goddamn better than it was before!

07:00.420 --> 07:02.790
What? So it's improved?

07:02.790 --> 07:04.250
That's good, right?

07:04.250 --> 07:06.880
What's good about that, four-eyes?

07:06.880 --> 07:09.790
You can't understand
just how humiliated I am!

07:10.290 --> 07:13.830
Oh! If you apply the formula there,
it's easy-peasy!

07:13.830 --> 07:16.250
Huh? You don't know the formula?

07:16.580 --> 07:19.630
Oh, stop it!
You're only pretending not to know.

07:19.630 --> 07:22.250
You don't need to make me look good.

07:22.250 --> 07:25.080
Oh, that's a different formula there also.

07:25.460 --> 07:27.630
Why are you looking at me like that?

07:27.630 --> 07:30.250
Did I do something wrong?

07:30.880 --> 07:33.710
That thing isn't my creation anymore!

07:33.710 --> 07:38.670
It's finished, but I can't love it!

07:38.670 --> 07:40.880
Are you really crying? Yikes.

07:47.130 --> 07:48.790
Mister Slime?

07:51.920 --> 07:55.670
Um... Mister Slime, keep your chin up.

07:55.670 --> 07:57.710
We got the doodles off you,

07:57.710 --> 08:00.580
and you don't have joints in the first place,
so you weren't actually damaged.

08:00.580 --> 08:02.380
Why should I keep my chin up?

08:02.380 --> 08:04.630
My pride as a shuperior life-form

08:04.630 --> 08:08.710
that shurpashes both humansh and dragonsh
hash been ripped to shredsh.

08:08.710 --> 08:11.920
I don't think I can look Mashter Crimshon
in the eyesh now.

08:12.250 --> 08:14.130
I didn't know you had a sense of pride.

08:14.130 --> 08:19.210
Only thoshe who who've had their ashholes
shtretched can undershtand how I feel.

08:19.750 --> 08:22.040
I was wondering where you were.

08:22.040 --> 08:24.580
Why did you go back to the cell?

08:25.630 --> 08:27.710
This is where I can relax the most.

08:27.710 --> 08:29.540
So where have you been?

08:29.540 --> 08:32.040
I've been busy taking care of some things.

08:32.040 --> 08:34.170
Did you save half your silverine
like I said to?

08:34.170 --> 08:35.170
Yeah.

08:35.170 --> 08:38.130
Then infuse all the rest
into a single weapon.

08:38.130 --> 08:39.540
You'll use that.

08:41.130 --> 08:43.670
Get a sword from the princess.

08:43.670 --> 08:45.000
When you infuse it,

08:45.000 --> 08:48.500
go as deep underground as you can
so the bloodline doesn't suspect anything.

08:48.500 --> 08:50.130
Wait, Crimson, hold on!

08:51.040 --> 08:53.880
Can you talk to Mister Slime?
He's really down in the dumps.

08:53.880 --> 08:55.960
I can't look you in the eyesh now.

08:55.960 --> 08:56.790
What?

08:58.420 --> 08:59.960
Purun!

09:00.210 --> 09:02.670
Puru? Where ish thish?

09:02.670 --> 09:04.920
Oh, Mashter Crimshon!

09:04.920 --> 09:06.630
Pleashe give me ordersh!

09:06.630 --> 09:08.630
I want to be usheful to you!

09:08.630 --> 09:12.170
Just give him a good whack,
and he'll forget any bad memories.

09:13.500 --> 09:17.460
Slime. Your job is to keep an eye
on this moron.

09:17.460 --> 09:22.040
Until the upcoming battle is over,
I want you on him like a tick.

09:22.040 --> 09:23.330
Undershtood!

09:23.330 --> 09:25.670
I'll watch thish shtupid human!

09:26.670 --> 09:29.420
The battle will probably begin around sunset.

09:29.420 --> 09:31.750
Get ready as quickly as possible.

09:31.750 --> 09:33.880
I'll be on my way now.

09:34.460 --> 09:36.830
And where do you plan on going, filth?

09:36.830 --> 09:40.080
Well, I was just going to take
a jaunt to dreamland.

09:40.080 --> 09:43.080
I'm so bored because there's
nothing to do around here!

09:43.790 --> 09:47.790
The people were getting disgruntled,
but they suddenly calmed down.

09:47.790 --> 09:49.330
Were you behind that?

09:49.330 --> 09:51.960
I have no idea what you're talking about.

09:53.170 --> 09:55.710
Did you come all the way here
just to ask me that?

09:57.500 --> 09:59.790
There's something I'd like
just the two of us to discuss.

10:00.830 --> 10:02.790
Come with me for a moment.

10:07.210 --> 10:11.710
Under normal circumstances,
I'd want to create a weapon just for you.

10:12.330 --> 10:14.580
But there is no time for that, unfortunately.

10:14.580 --> 10:16.710
So, you'll just have to make do with one of these.

10:17.670 --> 10:21.670
Wow, these are nice swords. Ma'am.

10:21.670 --> 10:23.420
B-but of course they are!

10:23.420 --> 10:27.040
Mass produced or not,
I'm the one who created them!

10:27.040 --> 10:28.880
But that's beside the point!

10:29.290 --> 10:34.040
There is something I must tell you
before the battle commences.

10:34.670 --> 10:38.670
She's meeting alone with
the man she's crushing on.

10:38.670 --> 10:40.710
Naturally, I have my concerns.

10:41.330 --> 10:44.790
After this, I plan on staying with
the Solarians.

10:45.710 --> 10:48.000
Even if our plan goes swimmingly,

10:48.000 --> 10:51.250
and we escape the country with
all our soldiers and civilians,

10:51.250 --> 10:53.170
what will happen then?

10:53.580 --> 10:57.670
How can I feed over a thousand people
in an unfamiliar country?

10:58.080 --> 11:00.500
There is only one surefire way.

11:00.880 --> 11:04.460
I must become a member of the Solarian church
and become a Dragon Scourge!

11:05.880 --> 11:10.000
And in exchange,
they shall protect my people.

11:10.790 --> 11:13.500
The only lands that will risk
angering the Blood of the Wing

11:13.500 --> 11:15.920
and welcome Lese's people

11:15.920 --> 11:18.250
are the Solarian territories.

11:18.250 --> 11:20.750
Do you know what the Solarians are like?

11:20.750 --> 11:24.170
I do. They offered to take me in once already.

11:24.170 --> 11:26.630
I turned down their offer
because it displeased me,

11:26.630 --> 11:29.580
but it's no longer a matter of preference.

11:29.960 --> 11:33.920
I shall be their Dragon Scourge,
their Silverware Princess.

11:34.130 --> 11:35.630
However...

11:35.630 --> 11:38.630
that's only if everything goes smoothly.

11:38.920 --> 11:42.000
If I lose my life in this battle,
my people have no future,

11:42.000 --> 11:44.500
even supposing they escape.

11:45.080 --> 11:47.880
Hence, I have a request to ask of you.

11:47.880 --> 11:52.380
If I die, will you become
a Dragon Scourge in my stead

11:52.380 --> 11:54.630
and lead my people and soldiers?

11:56.960 --> 12:02.080
I know you have no obligation
to take on this burden.

12:02.080 --> 12:06.670
But I'm asking you to please take on
this dying woman's wish anyway.

12:06.670 --> 12:10.420
If you so desire it,
I'll do anything you ask of me-

12:10.420 --> 12:11.630
I won't do it.

12:12.460 --> 12:14.540
I'm not a fan of that religion.

12:14.540 --> 12:15.830
What?

12:16.920 --> 12:20.130
We don't see eye to eye
on how to exterminate the dragons.

12:20.130 --> 12:22.960
Sorry, but you'll have to become
a Dragon Scourge yourself.

12:23.330 --> 12:26.330
But I won't be able to!
That's why I'm asking you.

12:26.330 --> 12:28.040
Why won't you?

12:28.040 --> 12:30.790
You're acting like your death
is set in stone.

12:33.250 --> 12:35.630
I've lived my life based on my intuition.

12:36.420 --> 12:40.330
Guiding my actions with intuition
over common sense

12:40.330 --> 12:42.420
is what made me who I am today.

12:43.830 --> 12:47.630
Ever since the battle with
the Blood of the Wing began,

12:48.290 --> 12:51.130
I've had this premonition
that I'm fated to die.

12:51.960 --> 12:55.830
But I will not show any weakness!

12:55.830 --> 12:57.420
And that's because...

12:57.710 --> 13:00.670
I'm the commander of this corps!

13:00.670 --> 13:03.920
It's only natural I'd plan and prepare
for my own demise!

13:05.130 --> 13:06.540
That's it.

13:07.040 --> 13:09.540
I know what approach
I should take with this man!

13:11.080 --> 13:12.960
I want to be liked.

13:12.960 --> 13:15.170
I want to be thought of as cute.

13:15.830 --> 13:18.330
I never thought I'd think like that.

13:18.960 --> 13:21.170
Love is a strange thing.

13:21.670 --> 13:25.290
It's not in my nature to make requests.

13:25.630 --> 13:30.170
He may be the man I love,
but I must be myself and only myself!

13:30.170 --> 13:32.420
If I'm hated for that, so be it!

13:32.830 --> 13:34.920
Do you remember what you told me, Ragna?

13:34.920 --> 13:38.080
"Use me. I promise I can help you."

13:38.420 --> 13:41.920
You are my subordinate in this operation!

13:41.920 --> 13:43.750
You will obey my orders!

13:43.750 --> 13:45.750
If you cannot obey me,

13:45.750 --> 13:47.880
you are useless!

13:48.880 --> 13:51.380
This woman is incredible.

13:52.790 --> 13:57.210
During battles,
I hardly ever think about dying.

13:57.210 --> 14:00.670
And if I do, I think about
how it'd be fine if I die.

14:00.670 --> 14:02.630
That's how I've always seen it.

14:02.630 --> 14:04.130
Even now.

14:04.750 --> 14:07.750
But even as she's about to dive
headfirst into battle,

14:07.750 --> 14:10.580
she's preparing for her own death
and planning for it.

14:11.130 --> 14:13.460
She's more capable than me.

14:13.460 --> 14:15.500
Her willpower shines so brightly.

14:15.500 --> 14:18.670
It makes you want to see
what future she's striving for.

14:18.670 --> 14:19.960
She's just like...

14:20.540 --> 14:24.750
Were the Silverware Princess and her
comrades in your future?

14:25.830 --> 14:28.790
Oh, I get it now.

14:28.790 --> 14:30.500
What is your answer?

14:31.130 --> 14:37.960
I've always wanted people like her
to survive instead of me!

14:39.460 --> 14:41.290
My answer is...

14:44.080 --> 14:45.830
Silverine Battle Arts.

14:51.710 --> 14:54.960
I'll put the rest of my power
into these swords!

14:56.250 --> 14:57.380
Stronger!

14:57.960 --> 14:59.000
Stronger!

14:59.920 --> 15:01.040
Stronger!

15:02.790 --> 15:05.290
Become a Dragon Scourge yourself.

15:05.670 --> 15:07.580
I won't let you die.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.380
Taratectra.

15:10.960 --> 15:12.420
Olto Zora.

15:13.000 --> 15:15.210
An army of ten thousand dragons.

15:15.580 --> 15:17.130
They're nothing!

15:18.080 --> 15:21.080
They will all perish beneath our blades!

15:34.920 --> 15:37.710
Did I say something wrong?

15:39.880 --> 15:43.210
What was that? It was so...

15:43.830 --> 15:46.250
Your Highness, what is the matter?

15:46.670 --> 15:48.710
I can't believe it.

15:48.710 --> 15:51.750
Was he putting his all into that?

15:51.750 --> 15:53.250
If so...

15:55.960 --> 15:59.880
My swords are completely unworthy!

15:59.880 --> 16:03.210
And earlier I was so overjoyed
when he complimented my swords!

16:03.210 --> 16:04.670
How laughable!

16:04.670 --> 16:07.330
This is the first time I've felt
this humiliated in my life!

16:07.330 --> 16:09.540
Damn you! Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!

16:10.880 --> 16:13.210
I won't let this be the end.

16:13.210 --> 16:16.630
From now on, I'll grow even further!

16:16.630 --> 16:18.750
I will craft great swords!

16:18.750 --> 16:21.420
I will not die here!

16:42.170 --> 16:43.460
Dragon!

16:48.880 --> 16:51.250
Why are dragons coming out of the royal pa-

16:55.250 --> 16:57.210
S-soldiers!

16:57.210 --> 16:59.420
Help! Save us!

16:59.420 --> 17:01.920
Dragons are coming out of the palace!

17:02.670 --> 17:03.630
What?

17:03.630 --> 17:05.210
Why is the army...

17:11.130 --> 17:12.670
The Mad Maestro.

17:12.670 --> 17:13.790
Why'd you stop?

17:13.790 --> 17:14.540
Get moving!

17:14.540 --> 17:15.290
Hurry!

17:15.290 --> 17:16.500
Go mad...

17:18.250 --> 17:19.460
And dance for me!

17:33.500 --> 17:39.330
Borgius, the Verdant Sea Dragon,
has begun regenerating his body.

17:45.000 --> 17:46.170
Progenitor,

17:47.540 --> 17:51.170
give me the blood of the humans
in the royal capital.

17:53.540 --> 17:57.130
Five hundred thousand of them
should be sufficient.

17:57.130 --> 17:58.040
Huh?

17:58.460 --> 18:03.670
Loyalty is not merely calmly giving
your life for your liege.

18:03.670 --> 18:06.380
However, giving my life seems to be

18:06.380 --> 18:10.540
the best way for this old buzzard
to fulfill his duty.

18:11.880 --> 18:15.750
I must ask Nebulim to take over
commanding the beasts.

18:16.960 --> 18:20.330
This is a good opportunity for him
to gain experience, is it not?

18:20.330 --> 18:21.920
Is that agreeable, Zora?

18:22.630 --> 18:24.170
Are you serious?

18:24.500 --> 18:27.330
I will not live long anyway.

18:27.580 --> 18:30.500
Now that mighty foes are
after the progenitor,

18:30.500 --> 18:34.920
this is my only chance to use up
what remains of my life.

18:34.920 --> 18:36.960
E-Elder...

18:37.750 --> 18:42.830
I survived the former Winged Monarch's madness
and the bloodline's destruction.

18:42.830 --> 18:48.830
I lived on with only the wish to see
our bloodline revitalized.

18:49.330 --> 18:52.040
You, my progenitor,

18:52.040 --> 18:54.920
made that wish come true.

18:57.130 --> 19:01.040
So, you shall leave me too.

19:01.330 --> 19:04.330
I don't see the problem.
Let him suit himself.

19:04.960 --> 19:06.830
I totally get you, gramps.

19:07.290 --> 19:10.250
You don't wanna just twiddle your thumbs
while you shrivel up and die!

19:10.250 --> 19:12.250
Even if it's only for a moment,

19:12.250 --> 19:15.670
you want to feel young again
and go out with a bang.

19:18.790 --> 19:20.290
The sun's setting...

19:21.130 --> 19:23.460
Something is stirring, Greya.

19:23.960 --> 19:27.210
Yeah, it's getting tense, Hesela.

19:28.000 --> 19:29.500
They're coming!

19:29.500 --> 19:31.250
Come on!

19:34.170 --> 19:35.330
Hmph.

19:35.330 --> 19:37.130
Whatever, who cares.

19:45.500 --> 19:48.750
All right, all right! Sorry for the hold up.

19:48.750 --> 19:51.830
Let's get on with it!

20:02.330 --> 20:05.040
They broke the barrier I put in the ground.

20:05.040 --> 20:06.130
They're here!

20:06.130 --> 20:08.040
What staggering mass!

20:08.040 --> 20:09.960
But this base will withstan-

20:17.170 --> 20:18.960
Explosive Mass!

20:22.790 --> 20:24.790
What? It's coming down!

20:24.790 --> 20:26.000
It's so fast!

20:26.000 --> 20:27.710
It'll destroy the base!

20:27.710 --> 20:29.290
If I don't do something in time...

20:29.290 --> 20:30.460
That'll be it!

20:30.670 --> 20:33.210
Nope. We have a way to counter that.

20:33.500 --> 20:35.580
Prepare for impact!

20:52.710 --> 20:59.170
That aerial attack was supposed to blow up
the cliff that makes up the top of the base.

20:59.710 --> 21:01.040
Tara, darling?

21:01.040 --> 21:02.670
Answer me, Tara, dearest!

21:03.040 --> 21:05.170
Don't call me Tara.

21:05.710 --> 21:09.380
I was countered when I was
about to collide with the tower.

21:09.380 --> 21:10.710
Countered?

21:10.710 --> 21:12.380
In your dragon form?

21:12.380 --> 21:14.830
Impossible! Unless...

21:14.830 --> 21:16.130
No.

21:17.040 --> 21:20.000
It wasn't coming from his body.

21:20.000 --> 21:23.750
His swords were producing
that powerful silverine.

21:23.750 --> 21:25.460
Be careful.

21:25.460 --> 21:27.960
As much as I loathe the idea,

21:27.960 --> 21:30.670
I'll have to call Kamui if the Reaper is here.

21:30.670 --> 21:33.920
I'm well-aware of my own capabilities.

21:33.920 --> 21:38.080
Okay. Then I'll leave this enemy in your hands.

21:38.080 --> 21:39.330
All right.

21:39.330 --> 21:40.790
Good luck.

21:41.420 --> 21:43.380
I want to know your name.

21:44.500 --> 21:46.920
I'm lousy at talking to other people.

21:47.670 --> 21:50.380
But I hate talking to dragons,
so I'm keeping quiet.

21:50.580 --> 21:52.250
A man of few words.

21:52.250 --> 21:56.330
Then let us speak candidly
through our fighting strength.

21:56.330 --> 21:57.420
No.

21:57.920 --> 22:01.000
March 10th, 7:35 PM.

22:01.500 --> 22:05.290
Olto Zora and Taratectra lead
an army of ten thousand dragons

22:05.920 --> 22:08.750
into battle against the Argentum Corps.
